    <!-- ── PART G ── -->
    <h2 class="sec" id="part-g-regulation-collapses-and-the-bigger-picture">Part G · regulation, collapses, and the bigger picture</h2>

    <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:1rem;">
      <div class="clabel" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Regulatory stances by region — explore</div>
      <div class="button-set-spaced" id="reg-btns"></div>
